WEBVTT

00:18:30.371 --> 00:18:31.829
That's a tough thing, don't you think?

00:18:32.163 --> 00:18:35.038
Yeah, I agree. I think the first
thing that comes to mind is

00:18:35.038 --> 00:18:39.329
I read some research earlier this week
showing that when leaders have employees

00:18:39.621 --> 00:18:41.288
who are courageous and daring,

00:18:41.996 --> 00:18:47.746
that sometimes they feel like that gives
them a pass and they say, OK, you know,

00:18:47.954 --> 00:18:51.913
my people have got this. And so I don't
have to demonstrate the same integrity,

00:18:52.413 --> 00:18:55.413
which, of course, is the exact opposite
of what you would want to see.

00:18:55.579 --> 00:18:58.163
And it goes to something I've been
wondering about that your work has really

00:18:58.163 --> 00:19:01.204
pushed me to think a lot about,
which is, you know,